{"ID":"20240118151037-se62hsb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151037-se62hsb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151037-se62hsb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151037-y3nxj6j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122143300-hwpj9mt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122143300-hwpj9mt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:27,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:27\u0026#125;","title":"257铅丹","type":"doc","updated":"20240202105738"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151037-y3nxj6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151037-y3nxj6j","updated":"20240122143235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，微寒，治吐逆，胃反，惊痫，癫疾，除热，下气，炼化还成九光，久服通神明。生平泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143239-caymkdi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143239-caymkdi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国四川山中，各国亦多有之，色青，故又名青铅。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143240-0beswoz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143240-0beswoz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143242-3877v83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143242-3877v83"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】铅为镇心坠痰解毒要药，主治积聚，噎膈，恶疮，性重平肝逆，能堕胎。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143244-reipkjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143244-reipkjb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】主镇心安神，治伤寒毒气，反胃呕哕，蛇蜴所咬，炙熨之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143246-2vjmk8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143246-2vjmk8l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】内服用量宜少，外用无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143247-b1fsgiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143247-b1fsgiw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】性质重坠，能碍消化，虚者慎用，孕妇忌用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143236-at8l4qr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143236-at8l4qr"}},{"ID":"20240122143248-uf92q37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143248-uf92q37"}},{"ID":"20240122143248-18g5mta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143248-18g5mta","updated":"20240202105258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"257铅丹，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"铅丹我们会使用的一个地方就是癫痫"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这种金属类的药物，药性就比较沉，比较重，所以说你看本经的原文，它说味道是辛辣的，铅很毒啊。铅的味道是辛辣的，微寒，它是我们治专门筋腱癫痫使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122143255-euou1ac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143255-euou1ac","updated":"20240202105311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那产地呢，我们大陆的四川，颜色是青色的，所以我们又叫青铅。诸位看主治，因为它是金属类的药，所以他镇静的作用很强，能够祛痰，攻痰。诸位用到金石类的药物的时候都是很峻的药，剂量都不多。性重平肝逆，恶心吐逆，哦，肝有问题的时候，肝肿起来会吐逆，能够堕胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240122143300-hwpj9mt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143300-hwpj9mt","updated":"20240202105738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那【大明】主镇心安神，你看都是癫痫方面的，这个使用。所以说禁忌上面，因为它质重，非常的质重哦，能否妨碍消化，所以肠胃人虚的人，肠胃不好的人少用它，那铅的剂量呢，铅丹的剂量一般来说，一钱，一钱呢一点点，那已经很重了。"}]}]}